    "research-index": "<div class=\"sc-repo-grid\"><div class=\"sc-repo-list\"><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">Digital Grid Modernisation in Africa: Using Data, Automation and AI to Release Network Capacity</h2><p>The Global Grids Accelerator and a new IEA technology assessment have placed electricity networks at the centre of the development agenda. For African utilities, however, the highest-value digital investment is rarely the most fashionable one. StoneComms examines how meters, asset records, telemetry, remote control, grid-enhancing technologies and carefully governed AI can reduce losses, improve reliability and make existing networks work harder—without pretending that software can replace new lines, substations or solvent utilities.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-7-affordable-and-clean-energy\" title=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" aria-label=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;background-color:#FCC30B;color:#111;\">7</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-9-industry-innovation-and-infrastructure\" title=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" aria-label=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;background-color:#FD6925;color:#111;\">9</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-13-climate-action\" title=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" aria-label=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;background-color:#3F7E44;color:#fff;\">13</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/digital-grid-modernisation-africa-data-automation-ai-network-capacity\">Read research →</a></div></div><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/green-certified-offices-africa-investment-performance\" aria-label=\"Green-Certified Offices in Africa: Testing the Investment Case for Efficiency, Occupancy and Asset Resilience\"><img class=\"sc-repo-thumb\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a92be796568d7e2b4121557/6abcdd9150c0bca3e5962053_stonecomms-green-certified-offices-africa-investment-performance-hero.png\" alt=\"Stylised African business district with a modern shaded office building, landscaping and older commercial buildings behind it in StoneComms teal, gold and cream.\"></a><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">Green-Certified Offices in Africa: Testing the Investment Case for Efficiency, Occupancy and Asset Resilience</h2><p>Across several African office markets, the divide between prime, efficient buildings and ageing secondary stock is widening. South Africa now provides a decade of evidence that green-certified offices can outperform comparable conventional assets, while newer evidence from Botswana and other markets points to stronger occupier demand for resilient, resource-efficient space. The investment question is moving beyond whether sustainability costs more to whether inefficient buildings increasingly carry an obsolescence penalty.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-9-industry-innovation-and-infrastructure\" title=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" aria-label=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD6925;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">9</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-11-sustainable-cities-and-communities\" title=\"SDG 11: Sustainable Cities and Communities\" aria-label=\"SDG 11: Sustainable Cities and Communities\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD9D24;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">11</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-13-climate-action\" title=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" aria-label=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#3F7E44;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">13</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/green-certified-offices-africa-investment-performance\">Read research →</a></div></div><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/ai-compute-african-mini-grids-flexible-demand-electricity-access\" aria-label=\"AI Compute and African Mini-Grids: Testing Flexible Digital Demand as an Anchor for Electricity Access\"><img class=\"sc-repo-thumb\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a92be796568d7e2b4121557/6abcb59db9d3967b918f0967_stonecomms-ai-compute-african-mini-grids-flexible-demand-electricity-access-hero.png\" alt=\"Three African professionals inspect mini-grid controls beside solar panels, battery cabinets, a small computing annex, clinic and grain mill.\"></a><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">AI Compute and African Mini-Grids: Testing Flexible Digital Demand as an Anchor for Electricity Access</h2><p>The Emergent Grid demonstration announced on 24 September 2026 asks an unusual infrastructure question. Could small, flexible computing loads buy electricity that African mini-grids are not yet selling, giving the power system steadier revenue while local demand grows? Initial sites in Kenya, the Democratic Republic of Congo and Sierra Leone are projected to serve or strengthen service for approximately 85,000 people. The proposition is promising precisely because it is not yet proven. Its value will depend on whether compute is genuinely interruptible, whether savings reach communities, whether digital revenue is additional, and whether the equipment leaves behind stronger local infrastructure rather than a remote enclave.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-7-affordable-and-clean-energy\" title=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" aria-label=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FCC30B;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">7</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-9-industry-innovation-and-infrastructure\" title=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" aria-label=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD6925;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">9</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/ai-compute-african-mini-grids-flexible-demand-electricity-access\">Read research →</a></div></div><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/connecting-african-schools-procurement-power-service-accountability\" aria-label=\"Connecting African Schools: Procurement, Power and Service Accountability for Digital Education\"><img class=\"sc-repo-thumb\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a92be796568d7e2b4121557/6ab4d1936c043dc4bd90a938_ChatGPT%20Image%20Sep%2024%2C%202026%2C%2008_30_16%20AM.png\" alt=\"A teacher and three learners work at an outdoor table beside a solar-powered African school while a technician checks a network cabinet.\"></a><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">Connecting African Schools: Procurement, Power and Service Accountability for Digital Education</h2><p>UNICEF’s September 2026 invitation to 96 prequalified companies creates a rare chance to procure connectivity services for schools and health facilities across all 54 African countries. The scale is arresting: a potential universe of more than 860,000 schools and 260,000 health facilities. The harder question is institutional. Can a contract for internet access become a durable education service—powered, maintained, used by teachers, safe for children and accountable to the public?</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-4-quality-education\" title=\"SDG 4: Quality Education\" aria-label=\"SDG 4: Quality Education\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#C5192D;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">4</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-7-affordable-and-clean-energy\" title=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" aria-label=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FCC30B;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">7</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-9-industry-innovation-and-infrastructure\" title=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" aria-label=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD6925;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">9</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-10-reduced-inequalities\" title=\"SDG 10: Reduced Inequalities\" aria-label=\"SDG 10: Reduced Inequalities\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#DD1367;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">10</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/connecting-african-schools-procurement-power-service-accountability\">Read research →</a></div></div><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/currency-before-concrete-africa-local-currency-infrastructure-finance\" aria-label=\"Local-Currency Infrastructure Finance in Africa: Converting Domestic Savings into Investable Assets\"><img class=\"sc-repo-thumb\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a92be796568d7e2b4121557/6ab4d3fe5a25b02a98b88bd5_ChatGPT%20Image%20Sep%2024%2C%202026%2C%2008_40_22%20AM.png\" alt=\"An investment officer, civil engineer and market-cooperative chair inspect a solar-roofed African public market and transport interchange.\"></a><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">Local-Currency Infrastructure Finance in Africa: Converting Domestic Savings into Investable Assets</h2><p>Africa’s financial institutions already hold substantial domestic savings. Yet infrastructure projects that earn in naira, shillings, rand or CFA francs are still frequently prepared for foreign-currency lenders, short-tenor banks or public balance sheets. New guarantee facilities in Nigeria and East Africa, together with a 2026 West African local-currency facility, show that the missing link is not simply money. It is the machinery that turns projects into assets pension trustees can prudently buy.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-8-decent-work-and-economic-growth\" title=\"SDG 8: Decent Work and Economic Growth\" aria-label=\"SDG 8: Decent Work and Economic Growth\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#A21942;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">8</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-9-industry-innovation-and-infrastructure\" title=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" aria-label=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD6925;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">9</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-17-partnerships-for-the-goals\" title=\"SDG 17: Partnerships for the Goals\" aria-label=\"SDG 17: Partnerships for the Goals\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#19486A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">17</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/currency-before-concrete-africa-local-currency-infrastructure-finance\">Read research →</a></div></div><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/cable-is-not-cloud-africa-digital-infrastructure-local-value\" aria-label=\"Africa's Digital Infrastructure: From Submarine Bandwidth to Local Economic Value\"><img class=\"sc-repo-thumb\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a92be796568d7e2b4121557/6aabb626cd0e3be9504e27ec_ChatGPT%20Image%20Sep%2017%2C%202026%2C%2010_42_54%20AM.png\" alt=\"A Djiboutian entrepreneur uses a laptop beside a network technician, data centre, solar array and Red Sea coast.\"></a><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">Africa's Digital Infrastructure: From Submarine Bandwidth to Local Economic Value</h2><p>Submarine cables have redrawn Africa's connectivity map. The next investment test is whether bandwidth can leave the landing station, be exchanged and processed locally, reach firms at a competitive price, and support work that generates income. Djibouti's exceptional cable position shows why geography creates an option—not an outcome.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-8-decent-work-and-economic-growth\" title=\"SDG 8: Decent Work and Economic Growth\" aria-label=\"SDG 8: Decent Work and Economic Growth\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#A21942;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">8</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-9-industry-innovation-and-infrastructure\" title=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" aria-label=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD6925;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">9</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-10-reduced-inequalities\" title=\"SDG 10: Reduced Inequalities\" aria-label=\"SDG 10: Reduced Inequalities\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#DD1367;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">10</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/cable-is-not-cloud-africa-digital-infrastructure-local-value\">Read research →</a></div></div><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/missing-span-africa-power-interconnectors-electricity-markets\" aria-label=\"Africa's Power Interconnectors: Market Readiness, Payment Security and Local Delivery\"><img class=\"sc-repo-thumb\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a92be796568d7e2b4121557/6aabb6736fbd81aaa995ace0_ChatGPT%20Image%20Sep%2017%2C%202026%2C%2010_44_12%20AM.png\" alt=\"A West African tailor works beside a grid technician while operators manage a substation connected to towns by transmission lines.\"></a><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">Africa's Power Interconnectors: Market Readiness, Payment Security and Local Delivery</h2><p>Africa is joining national grids into regional power systems. The next test is whether electricity can move through them reliably, be paid for, and reach the people and firms whose demand justified the investment. StoneComms examines the missing span between an interconnector's completion and a functioning market.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-7-affordable-and-clean-energy\" title=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" aria-label=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FCC30B;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">7</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-9-industry-innovation-and-infrastructure\" title=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" aria-label=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD6925;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">9</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-17-partnerships-for-the-goals\" title=\"SDG 17: Partnerships for the Goals\" aria-label=\"SDG 17: Partnerships for the Goals\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#19486A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">17</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/missing-span-africa-power-interconnectors-electricity-markets\">Read research →</a></div></div><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/map-before-money-africa-climate-risk-decision-infrastructure\" aria-label=\"Climate-Risk Data for African Infrastructure: From Hazard Mapping to Investable Resilience\"><img class=\"sc-repo-thumb\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a92be796568d7e2b4121557/6aa27cce4aefba74c87f9108_stonecomms-map-before-money-africa-climate-risk-decision-infrastructure-hero.png\" alt=\"Produce traders, municipal workers and residents use a shaded West African market street with trees, pale roofs and a public water point.\"></a><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">Climate-Risk Data for African Infrastructure: From Hazard Mapping to Investable Resilience</h2><p>Africa is gaining sharper maps of heat, flood and drought just as its cities make decisions that will shape exposure for decades. But a hazard map does not become a safer market, road, substation or neighbourhood by itself. The missing infrastructure is the chain that converts climate evidence into a named decision, an accountable owner, a financed intervention and a measured result. StoneComms proposes a Decision-Ready Climate Record for making that chain visible.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-9-industry-innovation-and-infrastructure\" title=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" aria-label=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD6925;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">9</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-11-sustainable-cities-and-communities\" title=\"SDG 11: Sustainable Cities and Communities\" aria-label=\"SDG 11: Sustainable Cities and Communities\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD9D24;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">11</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-13-climate-action\" title=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" aria-label=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#3F7E44;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">13</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-17-partnerships-for-the-goals\" title=\"SDG 17: Partnerships for the Goals\" aria-label=\"SDG 17: Partnerships for the Goals\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#19486A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">17</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/map-before-money-africa-climate-risk-decision-infrastructure\">Read research →</a></div></div><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/infrastructure-with-roots-africa-nature-based-resilience\" aria-label=\"Nature-Based Infrastructure in Africa: Financing, Maintenance and Resilience Performance\"><img class=\"sc-repo-thumb\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a92be796568d7e2b4121557/6a9ebcbb3a41987a15e23e5c_stonecomms-infrastructure-with-roots-africa-nature-based-resilience-hero-webflow.png\" alt=\"African infrastructure workers inspect a restored wetland protecting a raised road, market and distant port from floodwater.\"></a><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">Nature-Based Infrastructure in Africa: Financing, Maintenance and Resilience Performance</h2><p>Mangroves, wetlands, floodplains and urban green space can protect ports, roads, drainage systems and communities. Yet they are still commonly treated as environmental additions rather than working infrastructure. New African evidence makes the opportunity clearer - and exposes the institutional gap. StoneComms proposes a Living Infrastructure Contract for turning ecological protection into a financeable, maintained and accountable public service.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-9-industry-innovation-and-infrastructure\" title=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" aria-label=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD6925;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">9</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-11-sustainable-cities-and-communities\" title=\"SDG 11: Sustainable Cities and Communities\" aria-label=\"SDG 11: Sustainable Cities and Communities\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD9D24;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">11</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-13-climate-action\" title=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" aria-label=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#3F7E44;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">13</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-15-life-on-land\" title=\"SDG 15: Life on Land\" aria-label=\"SDG 15: Life on Land\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#56C02B;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">15</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/infrastructure-with-roots-africa-nature-based-resilience\">Read research →</a></div></div><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/hour-after-harvest-africa-cold-chain-service-design\" aria-label=\"Africa's Cold-Chain Infrastructure Gap: Service Design, Utilisation and Market Access\"><img class=\"sc-repo-thumb\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a92be796568d7e2b4121557/6a9929f6586a2d690ff6b224_stonecomms-hour-after-harvest-africa-cold-chain-service-design-hero.png\" alt=\"Fishers and produce traders using a shared cooling and market hub in Africa.\"></a><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">Africa's Cold-Chain Infrastructure Gap: Service Design, Utilisation and Market Access</h2><p>Africa does not only lose food because it lacks refrigerated rooms and vehicles. It loses value because farmers, fishers and traders often cannot buy reliable time: a few extra hours to aggregate, grade, negotiate and reach a better market. New 2026 evidence makes the scale of the opportunity clearer, while underused facilities show why hardware-led programmes fail. StoneComms proposes a Cold-Chain Service Test for turning cooling assets into durable market infrastructure.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-2-zero-hunger\" title=\"SDG 2: Zero Hunger\" aria-label=\"SDG 2: Zero Hunger\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#DDA63A;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">2</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-8-decent-work-and-economic-growth\" title=\"SDG 8: Decent Work and Economic Growth\" aria-label=\"SDG 8: Decent Work and Economic Growth\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#A21942;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">8</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-9-industry-innovation-and-infrastructure\" title=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" aria-label=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD6925;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">9</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-12-responsible-consumption-and-production\" title=\"SDG 12: Responsible Consumption and Production\" aria-label=\"SDG 12: Responsible Consumption and Production\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#BF8B2E;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">12</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/hour-after-harvest-africa-cold-chain-service-design\">Read research →</a></div></div><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/pipe-between-factories-africa-eco-industrial-parks\" aria-label=\"Industrial Symbiosis in African Industrial Parks: Shared Infrastructure and Competitiveness\"><img class=\"sc-repo-thumb\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a92be796568d7e2b4121557/6a954261a968f81655847b0f_ChatGPT%20Image%20Aug%2031%2C%202026%2C%2009_59_06%20AM.png\" alt=\"African industrial park linking energy, water, materials, production and logistics.\"></a><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">Industrial Symbiosis in African Industrial Parks: Shared Infrastructure and Competitiveness</h2><p>Rwanda is preparing to expand its industrial parks while studying how Korea turned waste heat, wastewater and by-products into competitive infrastructure. The lesson is larger than circular economy. Africa's zones can lower production costs, improve resilience and satisfy tougher export standards if park operators are equipped to measure, match, contract and finance exchanges between firms. StoneComms proposes a Symbiosis Readiness Test for deciding where that promise is commercially real - and where it is still decorative.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-8-decent-work-and-economic-growth\" title=\"SDG 8: Decent Work and Economic Growth\" aria-label=\"SDG 8: Decent Work and Economic Growth\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#A21942;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">8</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-9-industry-innovation-and-infrastructure\" title=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" aria-label=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD6925;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">9</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-12-responsible-consumption-and-production\" title=\"SDG 12: Responsible Consumption and Production\" aria-label=\"SDG 12: Responsible Consumption and Production\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#BF8B2E;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">12</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-13-climate-action\" title=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" aria-label=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#3F7E44;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">13</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/pipe-between-factories-africa-eco-industrial-parks\">Read research →</a></div></div><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/kilowatt-after-connection-mission-300-productive-use\" aria-label=\"Productive-Use Electrification in Africa: From Connection to Economic Activity under Mission 300\"><img class=\"sc-repo-thumb\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a92be796568d7e2b4121557/6a948e30afd05bc4618539d0_ChatGPT%20Image%20Aug%2030%2C%202026%2C%2009_10_03%20PM.png\" alt=\"Productive electricity demand linking farms, businesses and public services to distributed energy in Africa.\"></a><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">Productive-Use Electrification in Africa: From Connection to Economic Activity under Mission 300</h2><p>Mission 300 is accelerating electricity connections across Africa. The next challenge is making those connections economically durable. StoneComms finds that farms, small businesses, clinics, schools, cold chains and mobility can do more than benefit from electricity: they can become the anchor loads that improve the economics of distributed power itself.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-7-affordable-and-clean-energy\" title=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" aria-label=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FCC30B;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">7</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-8-decent-work-and-economic-growth\" title=\"SDG 8: Decent Work and Economic Growth\" aria-label=\"SDG 8: Decent Work and Economic Growth\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#A21942;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">8</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-9-industry-innovation-and-infrastructure\" title=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" aria-label=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD6925;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">9</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-17-partnerships-for-the-goals\" title=\"SDG 17: Partnerships for the Goals\" aria-label=\"SDG 17: Partnerships for the Goals\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#19486A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">17</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/kilowatt-after-connection-mission-300-productive-use\">Read research →</a></div></div><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/border-inside-factory-africa-production-systems\" aria-label=\"African Trade Integration: Customs, Corridors, Power, Payments and Standards as a Production System\"><img class=\"sc-repo-thumb\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a92be796568d7e2b4121557/6a947c73c99a4a52f180cf0e_ChatGPT%20Image%20Aug%2030%2C%202026%2C%2007_54_01%20PM.png\" alt=\"African regional production systems linking customs, corridors, power, payments and standards.\"></a><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">African Trade Integration: Customs, Corridors, Power, Payments and Standards as a Production System</h2><p>Africa has built the legal architecture for a continental market. The harder task is making the systems firms use every day work across borders. StoneComms tests that challenge against live reforms in East, West, Central and Southern Africa and finds a practical investment implication: regional infrastructure should be financed as an operating system, not a collection of assets.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-8-decent-work-and-economic-growth\" title=\"SDG 8: Decent Work and Economic Growth\" aria-label=\"SDG 8: Decent Work and Economic Growth\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#A21942;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">8</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-9-industry-innovation-and-infrastructure\" title=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" aria-label=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD6925;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">9</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-16-peace-justice-and-strong-institutions\" title=\"SDG 16: Peace, Justice and Strong Institutions\" aria-label=\"SDG 16: Peace, Justice and Strong Institutions\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#00689D;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">16</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-17-partnerships-for-the-goals\" title=\"SDG 17: Partnerships for the Goals\" aria-label=\"SDG 17: Partnerships for the Goals\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#19486A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">17</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/border-inside-factory-africa-production-systems\">Read research →</a></div></div><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/open-before-it-locks-kenya-battery-swapping-interoperability\" aria-label=\"Kenya's Battery-Swapping Market: Interoperability, Regulation and Investment Implications\"><img class=\"sc-repo-thumb\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a92be796568d7e2b4121557/6a944dc74ed50a4d3e8b0f79_African%20E-Mobility%20Battery%20Swap%20Station(3).png\" alt=\"African electric-mobility battery swap station serving motorcycles.\"></a><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">Kenya's Battery-Swapping Market: Interoperability, Regulation and Investment Implications</h2><p>Kenya has entered a rare policy window: electric mobility is scaling quickly, battery swapping is becoming infrastructure rather than a product feature, and the legal framework is still being written. The strategic question is not whether one battery should win. It is which interfaces must be shared before proprietary networks become expensive to unwind.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-7-affordable-and-clean-energy\" title=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" aria-label=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FCC30B;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">7</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-9-industry-innovation-and-infrastructure\" title=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" aria-label=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD6925;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">9</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-11-sustainable-cities-and-communities\" title=\"SDG 11: Sustainable Cities and Communities\" aria-label=\"SDG 11: Sustainable Cities and Communities\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD9D24;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">11</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-13-climate-action\" title=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" aria-label=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#3F7E44;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">13</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/open-before-it-locks-kenya-battery-swapping-interoperability\">Read research →</a></div></div></div></div>"
